OL,3,GNEWSADragon boat event hailed as
OL,4,Amassive success
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual dragon boat races on the
OL,7,FRiver Tyne have been hailed as a
OL,8,Fmassive success by the festival's
OL,9,Forganisers.
OL,11,FThe two-day event involved about 900
OL,12,Fpeople in dozens of boats racing
OL,13,Fbetween the Tyne and Millennium Bridges
OL,14,Fin front of thousands of spectators on
OL,15,Fthe Newcastle waterfront.
OL,17,FOrganised by NE1, an organisation
OL,18,Fchampioning Newcastle city-centre
OL,19,Fbusinesses, the event raises money for
OL,20,Fthe Sir Bobby Robson Foundation
OL,21,Fcharity.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
