OL,3,GNEWSADragon boat event hailed as
OL,4,Amassive success
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Fenwick, head of marketing and
OL,7,Fevents at NE1, said: "We're still
OL,8,Fwaiting for the official attendance
OL,9,Fnumbers and fundraising figures, but
OL,10,Fwe're confident that this year's dragon
OL,11,Fboat race will have broken all previous
OL,12,Frecords."
